[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3240.63, "timestamp": "00:54:00", "text": "いいえ。いいえ。いいえ。わかりました。 わかった。 ニース。 何てことだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3242.95, "timestamp": "00:54:02", "text": "うん。 人間とロボットの両方と戦わなければならない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3245.109, "timestamp": "00:54:05", "text": "。 どういう意味だよ？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3247.51, "timestamp": "00:54:07", "text": "ああ、このゲームではね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3249.03, "timestamp": "00:54:09", "text": "うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3252.069, "timestamp": "00:54:12", "text": "エクストラクションシューターへようこそ。 まさにその通り"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3253.109, "timestamp": "00:54:13", "text": "。  [笑い]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3268.39, "timestamp": "00:54:28", "text": "ええ、あちらでの試合が少し恋しかったです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3271.349, "timestamp": "00:54:31", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3273.589, "timestamp": "00:54:33", "text": "私は煙をかなり遠くに投げ捨てた。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3276.79, "timestamp": "00:54:36", "text": "抽出物には届きませんでした。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3277.51, "timestamp": "00:54:37", "text": "では、どうすれば"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3279.109, "timestamp": "00:54:39", "text": "バックパックを手に入れられるのでしょうか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3281.109, "timestamp": "00:54:41", "text": "うん。 うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3284.79, "timestamp": "00:54:44", "text": "契約を結んでから"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3286.23, "timestamp": "00:54:46", "text": "貴重品を回収する。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3287.43, "timestamp": "00:54:47", "text": "うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3291.109, "timestamp": "00:54:51", "text": "無料の戦利品はどこにあるの？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3293.75, "timestamp": "00:54:53", "text": "えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3297.03, "timestamp": "00:54:57", "text": "金庫をクリックして、武器庫に移動すると、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3299.349, "timestamp": "00:54:59", "text": "右側に「無料」と表示され、その下に"}]